'''Sant Martí del Nord Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Sant Martí del Nord}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: SMN, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: SMIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Sant Martí del Nord, Tramuntana|Sant Martí del Nord]], a remote highland community in the [[La Taula]] comarca of [[Tramuntana Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the far north of the isthmus and is the northernmost airport in the country. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

